  "description": "Cross-platform MIDI file reading and writing, MIDI message types, and SMPTE timing for the NAudio audio library. On Windows, also provides WinRT (Windows.Devices.Midi) live MIDI input and output.",
  "iconFile": "naudio-icon.png",
